# The website image builds the design system from source, so it does not need a
# host-side dist. packages/storyblok-mcp/Dockerfile does: it copies the built
# dist for token extraction and SSR component bundling, and excluding the whole
# tree made that build fail on "not found". Only the ~105 MB of screenshots under
# dist/static stay out, which is what that Dockerfile expects.
packages/design-system/dist/static
